[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.86]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.56]I never got their name until the credits
[00:13.06]now it plays here every single day
[00:17.54]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:21.46]One note at a time
[00:25.30]from people passing through
[00:30.06]a name beside a line
[00:35.30]and part of it is you
[00:48.06]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
